<h2>Part 2: Organization Administrator Dashboard Guide</h2>
<h3>Role Definition</h3>
<p><strong>Organization Administrator</strong> manages a specific partner organization within the ARCHR coalition (e.g., Habitat for Humanity - Buncombe County). This is <strong>not</strong> a platform super administrator.</p>
<p><strong>Primary Responsibilities:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Oversee applications assigned to their organization</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Manage caseworker assignments and workload</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Review and approve eligibility determinations</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Coordinate with subcontractors and volunteers</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Ensure timely processing of repairs</p>
</li>
</ul>
