<h3>Security Reminders for Admins</h3>
<p>markdown</p>
<h2>DO</h2>
<ul>
<li>Log out when leaving your workstation</li>
<li>Use organization-provided devices when possible</li>
<li>Report suspicious activity immediately</li>
<li>Lock screen when away from desk</li>
<li>Use strong, unique password (password manager encouraged)<h2>DON\'T</h2>
</li>
<li>Share login credentials with anyone</li>
<li>Discuss case details in public spaces</li>
<li>Email PII to external addresses</li>
<li>Download sensitive data to personal devices</li>
<li>Leave paperwork with client information visible</li>
</ul>
